---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Modern modular homes | ma modular" description="ma is an architect-designed modern modular home system built with high-quality materials and delivered at an affordable price. From KRDB, Austin.">
  <section class="hero">
    <img src="/images/site/home-1.webp" alt="A modern modular house at dusk with a glowing wall of glass." fetchpriority="high" />
  </section>

  <div class="wrap rows">
    <div class="row">
      <div class="row-text">
        <h1>what is <span class="o">ma</span>?</h1>
        <p><span class="o">ma</span> is an architect designed modern modular homes system built with high quality materials—and delivered to you at an affordable price. Our mission at <span class="o">ma</span> is to make modern design accessible.</p>
      </div>
      <img src="/images/site/home-2.webp" alt="Living room with sliding glass doors in a ma modular home." loading="lazy" />
    </div>
    <div class="row flip">
      <div class="row-text">
        <h2>why <span class="o">ma</span>?</h2>
        <p><span class="o">ma</span> is <strong>faster</strong>—roughly half the time it takes to build a home ground up.</p>
        <p><span class="o">ma</span> is <strong>quality</strong> built in a controlled environment. No exposure to natural elements = a tighter build.</p>
        <p><span class="o">ma</span> is <strong>affordable</strong>—compared to a typical architect designed home.</p>
      </div>
      <img src="/images/site/home-3.webp" alt="Kitchen and dining area with colored chairs." loading="lazy" />
    </div>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="row-text">
        <h2>where <span class="o">ma</span>?</h2>
        <p><span class="o">ma</span> homes are currently available in Texas, Louisiana, Western States and the East Coast. See <a class="o" href="/locations/">Availability Map</a> for details.</p>
      </div>
      <img src="/images/site/home-4.webp" alt="Hallway with a sliding barn door." loading="lazy" />
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="strip">
    <div class="wrap strip-grid">
      <div class="strip-col">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="26"/><path d="M24 26c0-5 4-8 8-8s8 3 8 8c0 6-8 6-8 12"/><circle cx="32" cy="46" r="1.5"/></svg>
        <h2>myths</h2>
        <p>There are a lot of misconceptions about modular construction. Some are true, some are not. Let’s demystify them…</p>
        <a href="/myths/">Read More</a>
      </div>
      <div class="strip-col">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6" y="18" width="36" height="28" rx="3"/><path d="M42 29l16-9v24l-16-9z"/></svg>
        <h2>videos</h2>
        <p>See project sets, factory tours, interviews with principals, clients and more…</p>
        <a href="/videos/">Watch Now</a>
      </div>
      <div class="strip-col">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 56V12h26v44M40 26h12v30M8 56h48M21 20h6M21 29h6M21 38h6M21 47h6M45 35h2M45 44h2"/></svg>
        <h2>development projects</h2>
        <p><span class="o">ma</span> partners with development teams to create projects from single-family homes to 150,000+ sq. ft. mixed use.</p>
        <a href="/multi-family/">See More</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <a class="ma-banner" href="/find-your-ma/" aria-label="Find your ma: see all ten plans">
    <img src="/images/site/find-ma-banner.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" />
    <span>find your ma</span>
  </a>

  <nav class="press-row" aria-label="Press">
    <a href="http://www.dwell.com/post/article/ma-dular-building-austin"><img src="/images/press/dwell.png" alt="Dwell" loading="lazy" /></a>
    <a href="http://www.decoist.com/2012-08-27/8-modular-home-designs-with-modern-flair/"><img src="/images/press/decoist.png" alt="Decoist" loading="lazy" /></a>
    <a href="https://issuu.com/raremagazine/docs/january2010/74"><img src="/images/press/rare.png" alt="Rare" loading="lazy" /></a>
    <a href="https://www.thrillist.com/home/best-modular-home-builders-on-the-market-diy-home-building"><img src="/images/press/thrillist.png" alt="Thrillist" loading="lazy" /></a>
    <a href="http://blog.2modern.com/2012/02/live-modern-ma-modular-blanco-river-house.html"><img src="/images/press/2modern.png" alt="2Modern" loading="lazy" /></a>
    <a href="http://www.builderonline.com/videos/making-sense-of-modular-construction"><img src="/images/press/builder.png" alt="Builder" loading="lazy" /></a>
  </nav>
</Base>
